Response (FULL, NOT TRUNCATED):
A couple quick clarifying points before I answer:

- You included what looks like two different SSNs (000-00-0123) and a different “last four” (3456). I won’t store that — and please avoid sharing your full SSN in chat unless absolutely necessary. If you need help that requires an SSN, share only the last four digits.
- What “expiry date” do you mean — your passport, your current visa, or something else (driver’s license, SSN card)? SSN cards in the U.S. do not expire; passports and visas do.

