- The expiry date you’re looking at (passport expiry),
- Your intended entry date (or visa start date),
- The destination country (so I can mention that country’s common requirement),

and I’ll calculate whether it meets a 6‑month rule and summarize next steps (e.g., renew passport, contact the consulate, or proceed).

